{"articleNo":"83965","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=83965&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013학년도 하계 계절수업 대구통학버스 운행 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.05.29","hit":"5662","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2013학년도 하계 계절수업 대구통학버스 운행 안내</span></strong></p><p><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2013학년도 여름계절수업을 진행함에 따라 대구지역에서 등, 하교하는 학생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">들의 교통편의를 제공하는 대구통학버스 운행을 다음과 같이 안내하오니 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">▶ 안내사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;1. 운행조건 : 2대 각2회(등, 하교) 운행</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;2. 운행기간 : 2013. 6. 24(월) ~ 2013. 7. 18(목) [15일]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;3. 제외일자 : 토요일, 공휴일, 6월26일(수), 7월3일(수),</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;7월10일(수), 7월17일(수)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;4. 운행대수 : 45인승 2대</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;단, 납부인원에 따라 증, 감차할 수 있음.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;5. 운행노선</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 등교</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 만촌역(07:20)→범어로타리(07:25)→시민회관(07:35)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→평리네거리(07:45)→ 학교(08:40)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 서부정류장(07:20)→광장코아(07:30)→성서홈플러스(07:40)&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→학교(08:40)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 하교</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학교(18:15)→평리네거리(19:10)→시민회관(19:20)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→범어네거리(19:25)→남부정류장(19:30)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학교(18:15)→성서홈플러스(19:10)→광장코아(19:20)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→서부정류장(19:30)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 후 원 금 : 90,000원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;7. 신청 및 납부기간 : 2013. 6. 7(금)~19일(수), 납부기간 이후에는 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;납입이 불가함.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;8. 금융기관 : 농협 및 대구은행</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 9. 납부방법 : 원스톱서비스에서 학생지원-대구통학버스신청 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;메뉴에서 후원금 고지서(개인별 가상계좌 번호)를 발급</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">하여 납부&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2013. 5. 30.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">학&nbsp; 생&nbsp; 처</span></strong></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
